                        <contentBlocks>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "f4a96b6b-abd8-49c6-8a6f-9f278b10c35b",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<div class=\"centro-ccw-report\">\n<section class=\"ccw-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"ccw-hero-title\">\n    <div class=\"ccw-hero__topline\">\n      <span class=\"ccw-hero__code\">CX Intelligence Report // LV-2026</span>\n      <span class=\"ccw-hero__status\">Signal Active</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"ccw-hero__body\">\n      <div>\n        <span class=\"ccw-hero__label\">What We Heard at CCW Las Vegas 2026</span>\n        <h2 class=\"ccw-hero__title\" id=\"ccw-hero-title\">\n          The Future of CX Is Built on <span>Better Operations</span>\n        </h2>\n        <p class=\"ccw-hero__copy\">\n          Across conversations with customer experience, contact center, and technology leaders, one message kept returning: new tools matter, but the quality of execution determines whether customers feel the difference.\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"ccw-hero__copy\">\n          AI, automation, and analytics create possibilities. Connected workflows, prepared teams, reliable handoffs, and operational visibility turn those possibilities into performance.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"ccw-hero__meta\" aria-label=\"Event details\">\n          <span>June 22–25, 2026</span>\n          <span>Caesars Forum</span>\n          <span>Las Vegas</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"ccw-radar\" aria-label=\"Customer experience operations signal map\">\n        <div class=\"ccw-radar__field\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <span class=\"ccw-radar__axis-x\"></span>\n          <span class=\"ccw-radar__axis-y\"></span>\n          <span class=\"ccw-radar__sweep\"></span>\n          <span class=\"ccw-radar__center\">OPS</span>\n          <span class=\"ccw-radar__node ccw-radar__node--ai\">AI</span>\n          <span class=\"ccw-radar__node ccw-radar__node--data\">Data</span>\n          <span class=\"ccw-radar__node ccw-radar__node--people\">People</span>\n          <span class=\"ccw-radar__node ccw-radar__node--journey\">Journey</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"ccw-scale\" aria-label=\"CCW Las Vegas event scale\">\n      <div class=\"ccw-scale__item\">\n        <strong>5,000+</strong>\n        <span>Attendees</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ccw-scale__item\">\n        <strong>54%</strong>\n        <span>Fortune 100 Represented</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ccw-scale__item\">\n        <strong>181+</strong>\n        <span>Programming Hours</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "ca4a10e7-2619-459b-bd73-849a029afbc0",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<div class=\"centro-ccw-report\">\n<section class=\"ccw-pulse\" aria-labelledby=\"ccw-pulse-title\">\n    <p class=\"ccw-kicker\">2026 Research Pulse</p>\n    <h2 class=\"ccw-section-title\" id=\"ccw-pulse-title\">Customers Want Automation and Human Access</h2>\n    <p class=\"ccw-section-copy\">\n      The operational challenge is not choosing between people and AI. It is designing journeys that use each where it creates the most value and move between them without losing context.\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"ccw-pulse__grid\">\n      <article class=\"ccw-pulse-card\">\n        <span class=\"ccw-pulse-card__ring\">75%</span>\n        <h3>Prefer Self-Service for Simple Needs</h3>\n        <p>Customers are comfortable using AI and self-service when the request is routine and the path to resolution is clear.</p>\n        <span class=\"ccw-pulse-card__source\">ServiceNow CX Shift, 2026</span>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"ccw-pulse-card\">\n        <span class=\"ccw-pulse-card__ring\">87%</span>\n        <h3>Want the Phone When It Gets Complicated</h3>\n        <p>Complex, sensitive, or high-effort situations still create strong demand for direct access to a person.</p>\n        <span class=\"ccw-pulse-card__source\">ServiceNow CX Shift, 2026</span>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"ccw-pulse-card\">\n        <span class=\"ccw-pulse-card__ring\">45%</span>\n        <h3>Rep Time Focused on Customer Support</h3>\n        <p>Frontline capacity is consumed by the work around the interaction, making better systems and workflows essential.</p>\n        <span class=\"ccw-pulse-card__source\">ServiceNow CX Shift, 2026</span>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "4a075e84-1b36-46bd-a08d-d4828bbf7914",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<div class=\"centro-ccw-report\">\n<section class=\"ccw-signals\" aria-labelledby=\"ccw-signals-title\">\n    <p class=\"ccw-kicker\">Field Notes</p>\n    <h2 class=\"ccw-section-title\" id=\"ccw-signals-title\">Five Signals That Cut Through the Noise</h2>\n    <p class=\"ccw-section-copy\">\n      The event floor was full of technology, but the most important conversations focused on how that technology becomes usable, accountable, and valuable inside real customer operations.\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"ccw-signals__grid\">\n      <article class=\"ccw-signal\">\n        <span class=\"ccw-signal__number\">SIGNAL 01</span>\n        <h3>AI Is Moving Beyond Experimentation</h3>\n        <p>Leaders are asking less about whether to use AI and more about where it belongs, what it should decide, and how its performance will be governed.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"ccw-signal\">\n        <span class=\"ccw-signal__number\">SIGNAL 02</span>\n        <h3>Human Judgment Is the Escalation Layer</h3>\n        <p>Automation works best when the organization has intentionally designed when context, emotion, risk, or complexity should move the interaction to a person.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"ccw-signal\">\n        <span class=\"ccw-signal__number\">SIGNAL 03</span>\n        <h3>Agent Enablement Is CX Infrastructure</h3>\n        <p>Better knowledge, guidance, and visibility help frontline teams make stronger decisions without adding unnecessary customer effort.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"ccw-signal\">\n        <span class=\"ccw-signal__number\">SIGNAL 04</span>\n        <h3>Connected Data Comes Before Personalization</h3>\n        <p>Personalization breaks down when customer history is fragmented, systems disagree, or channels cannot carry context forward.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"ccw-signal\">\n        <span class=\"ccw-signal__number\">SIGNAL 05</span>\n        <h3>Operational Control Makes Scale Possible</h3>\n        <p>Quality assurance, workforce planning, reporting, and structured improvement loops remain the foundation of consistent service at scale.</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000004",
      "key": "eb58344e-a840-437b-982a-5e99e220f446",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "heading",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Questions to Ask Your CX Operations"
        },
        {
          "alias": "level",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "[\"h2\"]"
        },
        {
          "alias": "anchorId",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "ccw-questions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000007",
      "key": "6c6d80fc-7cd0-4c1e-9b4e-f3faf119deea",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "question",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Where does customer context break today?"
        },
        {
          "alias": "answer",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Identify where customers are forced to repeat information across channels or between AI self-service and human support agents."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000007",
      "key": "f4b8a59d-f527-4e0e-80ea-ade95287a09a",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "question",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Which decisions should AI support, and which should remain human?"
        },
        {
          "alias": "answer",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Automate high-frequency, rule-based inquiries while directing complex, emotional, or high-value customer interactions to skilled representatives."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000007",
      "key": "af0d1b60-81ac-4f7c-ac02-d4d06b0f714d",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "question",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Do frontline teams have enough visibility to resolve the issue?"
        },
        {
          "alias": "answer",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Empower agents with unified CRM data, real-time knowledge bases, and clear authority to resolve inquiries on the first contact."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000007",
      "key": "79edd9b7-87d3-4eef-9f3e-c655c8d63f48",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "question",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Are CX metrics connected to business outcomes?"
        },
        {
          "alias": "answer",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Connect CSAT, FCR, and handle times directly to retention rates, customer lifetime value, and reduced cost-to-serve."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000007",
      "key": "0ad14045-17b8-4d66-a713-07aab5025d63",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "question",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Can the operating model scale without losing quality?"
        },
        {
          "alias": "answer",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Ensure robust training, continuous quality assurance, and flexible workforce management that maintain performance during volume spikes."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000008",
      "key": "09e4708c-d66d-4a0a-978f-aeaa52a7c293",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "eyebrow",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Next-Gen CX Operations"
        },
        {
          "alias": "title",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Build Operations That Deliver on the Promise of CX"
        },
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Explore how Centro combines intelligent automation with skilled human teams to scale customer operations without losing quality."
        },
        {
          "alias": "buttonLabel",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Connect With Centro"
        },
        {
          "alias": "buttonLink",
          "culture": "en-US",
